<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-COLONIAL CLASSIC RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-COLONIAL CLASSIC RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the Colonial Classic exhibition tennis event at Kooyong on Thursday.</p>
<p>Semifinal</p>
<p>Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Boris Becker (Germany) 2-6 6-4 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5)</p>
<p>Losers' playoffs</p>
<p>Michael Stich (Germany) beat Jim Courier (U.S.) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) beat Scott Draper (Australia) 6-4 6-3</p>
</text>
